# Build artifacts and test output -- generated, never committed.
#
# Committing obj/ also FALSELY trips the fleet secret scan: the Windows App SDK
# generates MSIX license XML under obj/.../MsixContent/MSIX/ that matches gitleaks'
# "generic-api-key" rule, which blocked an otherwise-clean WinUI merge (2026-06-24,
# the rocket-calc dead-button re-fire). Keeping build output out of git fixes that
# at the root: the scan runs on STAGED changes, so un-staged artifacts are never seen.
bin/
obj/

# The --test harness writes its pass/fail detail here at runtime (App.xaml.cs).
test-results.txt
